WEBVTT

Sintel's Search
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A woman walks up a mountain.

The gatekeepers
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
What brings you to the land of the gatekeepers?

Searching
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.500
I'm searching for someone.

The dragon
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:52.000
A little dragon flies toward the woman before a larger dragon snatches it away.
